### Collaborative To-Do List API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api

### CREATE - Valid Task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete assignment",
  "description": "Finish REST API project",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-30T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### CREATE - Missing Title (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "No title provided"
}

### CREATE - Title Too Long (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"
}

### CREATE - Empty Body (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### GET All Tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### GET Completed Tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?completed=true

### GET Incomplete Tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?completed=false

### GET Tasks - Invalid Completed Query (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks?completed=invalid

### GET Task By ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/6a82a5f901cf9e6af0f0059c

### GET Task - Nonexistent (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/000000000000000000000000

### GET Task - Invalid ID (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/notavalidid

### UPDATE Task
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/6a82a5f901cf9e6af0f0059c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated assignment",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "isCompleted": true,
  "dueDate": "2026-09-15T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### UPDATE Task - Title Too Long (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/6a82a5f901cf9e6af0f0059c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"
}

### UPDATE Task - Empty Title (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/6a82a5f901cf9e6af0f0059c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### UPDATE Task - Not Found (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost task"
}

### DELETE Task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/6a82a5f901cf9e6af0f005a2

### DELETE Task - Not Found (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/000000000000000000000000

### Unknown Route (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/unknown
